00:23:10,073 --> 00:23:11,333
We're really excited about it.

256
00:23:11,773 --> 00:23:12,634
It looks great.

257
00:23:13,114 --> 00:23:15,174
I mean, it's just such a great idea.

258
00:23:16,155 --> 00:23:17,235
But there's two things wrong.

259
00:23:18,135 --> 00:23:19,195
One, it's turn-based.

260
00:23:19,235 --> 00:23:20,616
And two, it needs to be multiplayer.

261
00:23:21,867 --> 00:23:21,967
and

262
00:23:41,340 --> 00:24:05,688
you know it would cost let's say five points to make some moves versus twenty points to make others and you know independent and we can call those you know whatever it's tenths of a second or something something cost takes a half a second to do something takes two seconds to do whatever and so it was this kind of we set up the whole game to have this kind of this detail of what uh... you know different skills took and how much time they took and things like that so

