00:24:06,628 --> 00:24:08,709
It was kind of a complicated turn-based game.

264
00:24:09,950 --> 00:24:19,315
And so eventually, Blizzard South, they approached us and said, well, we'd really like to make this a real-time game.

265
00:24:20,135 --> 00:24:22,357
And I said, what are you guys talking about?

266
00:24:22,457 --> 00:24:22,917
Real-time?

