00:24:22,957 --> 00:24:23,137
What?

268
00:24:23,197 --> 00:24:24,598
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

269
00:24:25,018 --> 00:24:28,320
This is one of your strategy games.

270
00:24:29,080 --> 00:24:32,782
We are, you know, I'm really committed to making a turn-based game here.

271
00:24:32,822 --> 00:24:34,543
I love this sweat.

272
00:24:34,843 --> 00:24:35,304
I love

273
00:24:36,244 --> 00:24:40,015
In a turn-based game, especially in a roguelike, when you've made a turn

