00:29:02,719 --> 00:29:04,200
I didn't know anything about business.

324
00:29:04,541 --> 00:29:06,222
Hell, we weren't even paying our taxes.

325
00:29:06,302 --> 00:29:07,723
I found out that that was a bad idea.

326
00:29:11,287 --> 00:29:15,350
