really because we felt that blizzard really got us and got the game and we were so close uh... in company culture and beliefs that uh... that we turned down twice as much money to uh... to be bought and become blizzard so little something there which doesn't make us the best businessman but another example of my worst business decision of my career late mid-ninety six

